# Nested deliberately, and load-bearing for deployment safety.
#
# hf_sync.yml runs `git init` and `git add .` INSIDE this directory to push the
# backend to a Hugging Face Space. That creates a fresh repository rooted here,
# so the .gitignore at the project root does not apply to it — its rules live
# outside the new repo entirely.
#
# Without this file, anything sitting in this folder at sync time is force-
# pushed to a public Space. Today that does not happen only because CI checks
# out a clean tree. This makes it true by construction instead of by luck.
#
# Secrets belong in the Space's own Secrets settings, where they arrive as
# environment variables. config.py reads through os.getenv(), so the same code
# works with a local .env here and with injected secrets there.

# ─── Never deploy secrets ─────────────────────────
.env
.passphrase
*.pem
*.key

# ─── Build artefacts and local state ──────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
faiss_index/
